# The run time's definition of a private name throws where the field exists, and a slot without an absent state always looks filled. So a private field that a definition by name creates has an absent state, whoever enumerates the keys
# FORM: AsRead
# OPTIONS: only-passes=AnalyzeFlow
# RUN: plan-slots layouts

# CHECK: L0 CompiledObject size=32 {{*}} unordered
# CHECK-NEXT: .0 #"count"@L0 OptionalDouble @16
# CHECK-NEXT: .1 "step" Double @24
# PROGRAM-OF: check-placement-private-definition.ir
